 ## Unreleased
 
+- `search` prints up to 25 matches by default, and `--limit 0` prints every match.
 - Eggs have their own aisle, `eggs`, straight after `dairy`.
 - `build_shopping_list()`, and so the `shop --csv` file, lists items alphabetically by name instead of by aisle.
 - Recipe ids use only `a-z 0-9 -`: accents are dropped and any other character separates words, so `Mac & Cheese` is `mac-cheese`.
